<title>UK: C.Local adds 50 million ecu to December 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>C.Local adds 50 million ecu to December 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond increase was announced by joint lead managers Banque Internationale a Luxembourg and Credit Communal/Gemeentekredit.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p> AMT   *150 MLN ECU   COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    31.DEC.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE**101.42    PAY DATE  S 04.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     YTM	  5.50	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> SALE LIMS  US/UK     LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 1-10</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    UK	  MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  1.75</p>
<p> NOTES     *ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 100 MLN ECU ON 17.DEC.96</p>
<p>	    **NEW ISSUE PRICE .</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
